{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">在處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演「大龍生」而深入民心的資深演員羅樂林，其敬業樂業的精神一直備受肯定。在昨日（8日）舉行的「2026年下半年度傑出員工嘉許計劃頒獎典禮」上，羅樂林實至名歸奪得「傑出員工獎」，以表揚他多年來卓越的工作表現與專業態度。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"13.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ubXhhZPrJU1791515865.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"13.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">羅樂林在接受傳媒訪問時展現出大前輩的霸氣與敬業。他坦言自己對待每一份工作都「搏到盡」，入行半世紀以來絕對沒有「渣流灘」（敷衍了事），更中氣十足地表示自己永不言休，這份對演藝事業的熱愛與堅持，實在令人敬佩。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">大龍生攞獎，當然少不了「龍家」成員的鼎力支持。當日劇中一眾演員，包括「二太」蘇恩磁、「三太」樊亦敏、「大小姐」林淑敏、「送水輝」許家傑以及「Joe少」何晉樂（Rock）均有親身出席頒獎禮撐場。他們更特意為羅樂林送上生日蛋糕和鮮花雙重祝賀，戲裏戲外感情依然要好。事後，許家傑在社交網分享了大合照，並留言大讚：「恭喜爸爸！咁多年嘅傑出表現，呢個獎當之無愧，真係龍咁威🐲！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"09.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ocq4IbCQLj1791515865.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"09.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"jackhero5_1791480412_4003549945779537397_566958223.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026WK4OmdDOPN1791515868.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"jackhero5_1791480412_4003549945779537397_566958223.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">至於劇中乖仔的「Terry」雖然未能親身出席，但依然極具心思。他親自繪畫了一幅畫像送給「爸爸」羅樂林，畫中羅樂林以一身經典「大龍生」造型現身手奪獎項，身後更有一條巨龍，完美捕捉了羅樂林的神態，畫功栩栩如生！Terry 亦在社交網發文祝賀：「今次真係龍咁威🥳龍爸爸今日攞傑出員工獎🐲🏆畫幅畫恭喜佢先🎉！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"liwaikinterryli_1791472657_4003483452954656815_2338467940.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DYkuYhvmBD1791515868.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"liwaikinterryli_1791472657_4003483452954656815_2338467940.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T03:59:39.574486+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":564,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}